{"synopsis":"Seorang pekerja kantoran biasa, Manajer Oh jatuh ke Demon Realm.\n\nKetika ia bangun, ia telah menjadi penguasa wilayah goblin yang berada di ambang kehancuran.\n\nUntuk hidup, ia harus mengambil. Untuk bertahan hidup, ia harus menaklukkan.\n\nBerbekal tekad seorang pekerja kantoran, ia bertekad untuk mengubah keseimbangan kekuasaan di Demon Realm.","alternative_title":"고블린 주식회사","author":"Mon","artist":"Beonin","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"kc_ch_goblin-inc_7","number":"7","chapter":"7","title":"Chapter 7","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_90f99e6c-d1db-4522-ab70-21c2e7c1adcd/chapter_kc_ch_goblin-inc_7/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"kc_ch_goblin-inc_6","number":"6","chapter":"6","title":"Chapter 6","dat